190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The selection process commenced with a quick joint planning meeting that took place at the district council halls simultaneously both in Moyamba and Kareneh district. Five days were set aside effectively starting Tuesday 9th and completed Saturday 13th of January 2024. What is interesting most in all the district exercises is the full participation and cooperation of the key stakeholders of the project including councils, MAFFS and chiefdom authorities.  )
/E (The selection process commenced with a quick joint planning meeting that took place at the district council halls simultaneously both in Moyamba and Kareneh district. Five days were set aside effectively starting Tuesday 9th and completed Saturday 13th of January 2024. What is interesting most in all the district exercises is the full participation and cooperation of the key stakeholders of the project including councils, MAFFS and chiefdom authorities.  )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
