196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Welthungerhilfe \(WHH\) Sierra Leone has been cooperating with MADAM since 2018. Currently, MADAM is implementing three BMZ-funded interventions in partnership with WHH: &quot; Skill Up! Strengthen Vocational Training, Create Prospects for the Future&quot; \(PN4411 from 01/07/2020 to 30/04/2023\), and &quot; Promoting Sustainable Food and Nutrition Security through Organic Agriculture in Falaba District \(ProFaNS\), in Northern Sierra Leone&quot; \(PN5917 from 01/10/2021 to 30/09/2024\). )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The SLE 1105 Promotes sustainable food and nutrition security through Climate-smart agriculture in the districts of Moyamba and Karene. These projects have enabled MADAM to extend its geographical reach to the newly created and severely underserved Falaba and Kareneh District, which is avoided by many development agencies because it is difficult to access. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In addition, the collaboration between MADAM and WHH has further strengthened the livelihoods portfolio of both organizations.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Introductory workshops organised by WHH for implementing partners )
/E (Introductory workshops organised by WHH for implementing partners )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (During this quarter reporting period, A two-day introductory project workshop was conducted as part of the inception meeting that took place at the MADAM Head office in Makeni between the donor organization WHH, and implementing partners at MADAM and SLAWs to further discuss and clarify certain issues that are of concern in the project SLE1105-PSuFoNS and for better understanding of the project by staff.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Among other issues discussed are Expectations from participants after the inception meeting, To get familiar with the Project objectives and goals, To Identify challenges and solutions for those challenges, To know the Roles and responsibilities of project staff, To Understand the project document, To Understand project specifics, Identification of key stakeholders and their level of involvement, Identify direct project beneficiaries, Understand the projects financial template, What is SLAWS and MADAM involvement, Learn more about cash management, Understand more about WHH procurement process, Clear guidelines of beneficiary selection and WHH reporting tools. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Participant of this inception meeting workshop was drawn from MADAM, SLAWS and WHH with a total number of 35 participants who attended the meeting.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
