/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The minister also served as the keynote speaker and officially commissioned the kickstart of the project in Kareneh District and Moyamba The occasion was witnessed by The Donors Welt Hunger Hilfe \(WHH\) the HOP@ Gospel, partnership Manager @ James Alpha and Tamba Borbor @communication, all in attendance together with other line ministries and key stakeholders of the district and chiefdoms including paramount chiefs, council chairman, section chiefs, councilors and representatives from all the FBOs. The Director of MADAM, Mohamed Sorie Conteh, HOP, Edward Conteh, and Sheku Gbla @ SLAWS spoke on behalf of the implementing partners and members of the project team from MADAM and SLAWS were in top gear to ensure the best was achieved.  The launching took place at LA Galaxy Hall Center in Kamakwi Kareneh and Moyamba District Council Hall. The launching targeted a population of 150 participants including 2 representatives of 40 FBOs, project team members, district stakeholders including line ministries, chiefdom authorities, and the media.)
/E (The minister also served as the keynote speaker and officially commissioned the kickstart of the project in Kareneh District and Moyamba The occasion was witnessed by The Donors Welt Hunger Hilfe \(WHH\) the HOP@ Gospel, partnership Manager @ James Alpha and Tamba Borbor @communication, all in attendance together with other line ministries and key stakeholders of the district and chiefdoms including paramount chiefs, council chairman, section chiefs, councilors and representatives from all the FBOs. The Director of MADAM, Mohamed Sorie Conteh, HOP, Edward Conteh, and Sheku Gbla @ SLAWS spoke on behalf of the implementing partners and members of the project team from MADAM and SLAWS were in top gear to ensure the best was achieved.  The launching took place at LA Galaxy Hall Center in Kamakwi Kareneh and Moyamba District Council Hall. The launching targeted a population of 150 participants including 2 representatives of 40 FBOs, project team members, district stakeholders including line ministries, chiefdom authorities, and the media.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
