262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (During this quarter reporting period, the training for the 1,000 women in compost production green manure preparation was completed in all 40 communities in the two districts of Kareneh and Moyamba . The facilitators of the sessions were drawn from the Ministry of Agriculture at the district level with support from the project team; three days was set for every community to train 25 members per group. The idea of the training is to prepare the vegetable women growers with enough knowledge on how to prepare compost pits and green manure to support their vegetable gardens. This will promote a high yield of harvest of vegetables in their farms.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
