/T (During this quarter reporting period, we are able to also support the 1,000 female vegetable farmers Groups to completed their nursing of seedlings , correct practices of weeding around the nursery sites and methods of transplanting, bush clearing and land tilling, bed construction and preparing for transplanting and direct planting. We encourage men to support the women in bush clearing and tilling the land which shows their commitment towards the project since the project's direct beneficiaries were 100% women. )
