/T (During this Quarterly reporting period, land identification and location for the construction of the greenhouse including market building, hatchery, boreholes and rabbit hutches was conducted by the project team with technical support by the WHH engineer Thomas Foray to initiate BOQ before the procurement process starts. A selection criterion for the location of the facility was followed and consultation of district key stakeholders including council, chiefs and ministry of agriculture where part of the land identification and selection. The developments of the BOQ were all completed during this reporting period before the construction starts in the following quarter.)
/E (During this Quarterly reporting period, land identification and location for the construction of the greenhouse including market building, hatchery, boreholes and rabbit hutches was conducted by the project team with technical support by the WHH engineer Thomas Foray to initiate BOQ before the procurement process starts. A selection criterion for the location of the facility was followed and consultation of district key stakeholders including council, chiefs and ministry of agriculture where part of the land identification and selection. The developments of the BOQ were all completed during this reporting period before the construction starts in the following quarter.)
