<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (During this Quarter reporting period, The project team has COMPLETED the community level training rollout sessions for 2000 women on Linking Agriculture and Natural Resources Management \(LANN+\) modules. After a successful conduct of the TOT training for staff hosted in Makeni for a period of five days, on the community level rollout, the participants were drawn from FBOs of both the 25 women in vegetable production and the 25 women in livestock production in all the 40 communities of the project operational locations in Kareneh District. The training focused on the first module called KNOWING YOUR FOOD. This module has four sessions and all were completed with both practical and theoretical approaches which includes the following.  Now we have working nutritional approached at community level that have change the eating habits and cooking styles of project participants on a daily basis. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
