>>
endobj
325 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (During this Quarterly reporting period, Cluster meetings for the foundation of district cooperative meetings were successfully conducted, trained and formation of the cooperatives at district level. A total of 150 participants are put and organized into cluster meetings for the foundation of two district cooperatives, 75 in Kareneh and 75 participants in Moyamba to Mann the affairs of the farmers from both vegetable and livestock members of the project participants. 2 members are selected from each group to participate in a clusters meeting to discuss on the operation of the cooperative and initiate leadership to run the association democratically. The cluster meeting is being witnessed and Co-facilitated by the Ministry of Agriculture together with project team staff through the lead of the project Nutritionist officer Ester R. Mansaray. After the conclusion of the cluster meetings, a group of ten executive members are been selected democratically among the members present to form the district Cooperative Committee  who will be held responsible for managing the facilities the project will provide for and on behalf of the FBOs.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
